1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:26,560
Father...

25
00:02:33,910 --> 00:02:36,090
Noooo !!!

26
00:03:25,990 --> 00:03:27,580
It's time for dinner.

27
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,780
Hurry, let's eat.

28
00:03:40,750 --> 00:03:41,430
Father,

29
00:03:41,920 --> 00:03:42,620
Mother,

30
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,910
I miss you so much...

31
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:46,310
so much...

32
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:55,240
I didn't expect

33
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,980
that I would be able

34
00:03:57,920 --> 00:04:00,600
to condense my killing intent even further.

35
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:03,060
My state of heart wasn't right before.

36
00:04:19,940 --> 00:04:21,900
Ceng Da Niu

37
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:21,900
Woaaa !

38
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:29,250
Did Uncle make this ?

39
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:30,270
So cool.

40
00:04:31,470 --> 00:04:32,260
What's the matter ?

41
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,300
Oh, right.

42
00:04:34,110 --> 00:04:35,430
I came to give you this.

43
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,180
Now when a guest comes in,

44
00:04:50,190 --> 00:04:51,140
you will know.

45
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:55,550
This is for you.

46
00:04:59,750 --> 00:05:00,870
Thank you Uncle !

47
00:05:02,550 --> 00:05:03,200
Uncle,

48
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,350
my name is Da Niu.

49
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:06,220
I'm from the blacksmith across the street.

50
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:07,990
Remember to come and play with me.

51
00:05:14,010 --> 00:05:16,110
Ceng Niu
Ceng Da Niu's father

52
00:05:12,230 --> 00:05:13,550
Dad, Mom !

53
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:14,920
Look at this !

54
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,540
The uncle across the street gave it to me.

55
00:05:14,010 --> 00:05:16,110
Ceng Si
Ceng Da Niu's mother

56
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,380
Here, let me see.

57
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,940
Such an exquisite wood carving !

58
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,420
You little ignorant rascal !

59
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,270
Ouch, it hurts.

60
00:05:33,540 --> 00:05:34,080
Brother,

61
00:05:34,710 --> 00:05:35,550
excuse him.

62
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,760
The kid doesn't understand.

63
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,120
How much does it cost ?

64
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,310
I gifted it to him,

65
00:05:40,350 --> 00:05:42,010
it's just a piece of wood after all.

66
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:50,260
You just arrived, right ?

67
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:53,190
The shop across the street has been empty for years.

68
00:05:53,790 --> 00:05:54,590
Brother,

69
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,780
if you don't mind,

70
00:05:56,070 --> 00:05:57,270
come over for a meal.

71
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,750
I have homemade wine.

72
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:02,080
It's much better than the wine in restaurants !

73
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,180
Okay.

74
00:06:05,590 --> 00:06:06,060
Thank you.

75
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,060
You're welcome.

76
00:06:08,380 --> 00:06:10,460
We'll be neighbors from now on.

77
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:11,820
Let's go !

78
00:06:11,820 --> 00:06:13,000
I'll show you around.

79
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:23,150
How long has it been since I last ate ?

80
00:06:24,030 --> 00:06:26,220
I stopped eating at Foundation Establishment.

81
00:06:29,550 --> 00:06:31,830
Does it not suit your taste ?

82
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,310
Brother,

83
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,280
We only have this simple food.

84
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:36,190
I'm sorry.

85
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:37,860
I like it.

86
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,700
Come on, eat this.

87
00:06:43,670 --> 00:06:44,840
Since you just arrived here,

88
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:46,060
you aren't familiar with this place.

89
00:06:46,070 --> 00:06:47,110
If you need anything,

90
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,230
let us know.

91
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,590
As neighbours, we should help each other.

92
00:06:51,270 --> 00:06:52,460
If you need groceries,

93
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,920
go to the Li Family's shop,

94
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:56,140
it's good and affordable.

95
00:06:58,110 --> 00:07:00,180
The Xu Family's shop is expensive

96
00:07:00,590 --> 00:07:02,060
but the people are kind.

97
00:07:02,670 --> 00:07:05,140
I heard that their young master is very successful.

98
00:07:05,590 --> 00:07:06,840
He's following the Crown Prince.

99
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:10,740
The craft of brewing wine is passed down in our family.

100
00:07:10,900 --> 00:07:11,590
Try it.

101
00:07:17,300 --> 00:07:18,080
It's a good wine !

102
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,500
Come on, one more.

103
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,560
Come on, eat more. Cheers.

104
00:07:25,790 --> 00:07:30,280
1 year later

105
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:36,550
Uncle Wang,

106
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,940
what kind of animal is this ?

107
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,960
It looks like a turtle

108
00:07:40,310 --> 00:07:41,590
but its head is weird.

109
00:08:12,910 --> 00:08:14,680
It's a kind of ancient creature.

110
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,590
Although it looks like this,

111
00:08:17,510 --> 00:08:18,960
in reality it's fierce

112
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:20,360
and powerful.

113
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:23,940
It sounds so cool !

114
00:08:26,490 --> 00:08:30,740
10 days later

115
00:08:31,910 --> 00:08:32,660
Uncle Wang,

116
00:08:32,830 --> 00:08:34,000
I'm here to deliver the wine.

117
00:09:08,110 --> 00:09:09,120
This is a fire spider.

118
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,040
It has a violent temperament

119
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,680
and its 8 legs are very sharp.

120
00:09:13,070 --> 00:09:14,360
Don't get hurt by one.

121
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,560
This is so interesting !

122
00:09:17,950 --> 00:09:18,710
Dad !

123
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,230
I don't want to be a blacksmith.

124
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,800
I want to learn wood carving !

125
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:22,990
What the hell are you talking about ?

126
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:25,150
You cannot even hold a forge hammer properly,

127
00:09:25,190 --> 00:09:26,940
yet you want to do fine work like Uncle Wang ?

128
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,260
You little rascal !

129
00:09:28,350 --> 00:09:29,620
Ouch !

130
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,760
Like a breeze,

131
00:09:39,390 --> 00:09:41,800
4 seasons have already gone by.

132
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,360
Because my cultivation is limited,

133
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:46,990
I cannot carve Soul Formation cultivators.

134
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,640
But it doesn't matter,

135
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:49,830
the journey is long.

136
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:52,660
I carved my memories,

137
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,600
the villagers of the Wang Family,

138
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:56,310
Spirit Beasts I have faced.

139
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:58,920
They seem to have been reborn

140
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:01,020
when I carve them this way.

141
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:13,320
When I condense a fourth bead,

142
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:16,040
the killing intent will disappear.

143
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:19,400
Look at this !

144
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,570
It's a great wood carving.

145
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:22,150
Indeed !

146
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:23,310
It's really good.

147
00:10:25,760 --> 00:10:26,660
Not bad...

148
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,350
It's like a real one.

149
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:29,860
Look at this one !

150
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,590
Let's look at this one.

151
00:10:32,110 --> 00:10:33,630
Everyone praises how good they are,

152
00:10:33,870 --> 00:10:35,620
but no one buys them.

153
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,740
Master Xu is coming back.

154
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,050
Master Xu follows the Crown Prince

155
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,380
he's a great man now !

156
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,090
Come, have a look !

157
00:10:59,740 --> 00:11:00,500
Da Niu,

158
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:01,990
let go of me, okay ?

159
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:03,860
Master Xu,

160
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,230
look at these wood carvings.

161
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,900
They are better than those of the Zhou Family.

162
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,540
So... Will you buy one ?

163
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:11,020
Xu Tao

164
00:11:12,300 --> 00:11:13,800
Don't sell it too expensive.

165
00:11:33,280 --> 00:11:34,730
When you touch these wood carvings,

166
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:36,560
it feels strange right ?

167
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,320
I usually just look at them.

168
00:11:39,540 --> 00:11:40,240
I'm sorry.

169
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:42,690
It's okay.

170
00:11:43,100 --> 00:11:45,860
Sir, what kind of animal is it ?

171
00:11:46,250 --> 00:11:48,020
Why does it look like a snake to me ?

172
00:11:48,030 --> 00:11:49,110
This is a Flood Dragon !

173
00:11:49,270 --> 00:11:50,950
It's an immortal creature !

174
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:52,920
A Flood Dragon ?

175
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:55,390
How much does this carving cost ?

176
00:11:57,470 --> 00:11:58,430
10 taels of gold.

177
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:02,760
No...

178
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:04,720
it's so over...

179
00:12:05,150 --> 00:12:06,080
Thank you, sir.

180
00:12:06,430 --> 00:12:07,510
I want this wood carving.

181
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:10,720
Goodbye.

182
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:14,660
10 taels of gold ?

183
00:12:19,590 --> 00:12:21,180
His Highness loves beautiful carvings.

184
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:22,990
The Crown Prince is principled,

185
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:25,270
if I give him this carving

186
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,180
he will praise me for sure.

187
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,020
Your Highness,

188
00:12:30,040 --> 00:12:31,550
Xu Tao wants to see you.

189
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:34,700
Thank you, your Highness.

190
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,450
What's going on ?

191
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,450
We can talk tomorrow.

192
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,500
Your Highness,

193
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:42,200
I found a wood carving I think you will like.

194
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:44,280
If his Highness sees it,

195
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:45,260
he will understand.

196
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:54,690
Crown Prince
8th layer of Qi Condensation

197
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,330
Your Highness, don't touch it !

198
00:13:04,820 --> 00:13:05,750
This is a treasure.

199
00:13:06,470 --> 00:13:07,470
You have done a great service !

200
00:13:11,380 --> 00:13:12,360
Let's go.

201
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:13,750
Come with me to see my father.

202
00:13:25,180 --> 00:13:26,870
Mortal King

203
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,420
Zhou Qiao
White Could Sect disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

204
00:13:28,490 --> 00:13:29,710
Weng Qi
White Cloud Sect disciple
Early stage Core Formation

205
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,920
Why did you come to see me ?

206
00:13:36,920 --> 00:13:38,320
Weren't you having fun ?

207
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:42,540
Father, look.

208
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,060
This is...

209
00:13:50,070 --> 00:13:51,340
This is a wood carving.

210
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:53,710
Senior Brother, of course I know this is a wood carving !

211
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:56,150
I mean, what is this a carving of ?

212
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:58,760
I haven't seen it before.

213
00:13:59,540 --> 00:14:00,430
Immortal Elders,

214
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,660
is there anything special about this carving ?

215
00:14:08,190 --> 00:14:09,150
This wood carving...

216
00:14:09,350 --> 00:14:10,730
the higher your cultivation

217
00:14:10,750 --> 00:14:12,160
the more you are affected by it.

218
00:14:12,190 --> 00:14:13,190
But for mortals,

219
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,510
the effect is small.

220
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,450
This object

221
00:14:15,480 --> 00:14:17,310
is not a normal carving.

222
00:14:17,470 --> 00:14:19,160
The creature that is carved is almost the same

223
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:22,200
as the Flood Dragon in the ancient records of our sect.

224
00:14:22,310 --> 00:14:24,520
But you said you had not seen it before...

225
00:14:25,830 --> 00:14:26,930
It doesn't mean

226
00:14:27,110 --> 00:14:29,000
that I didn't recognize it.

227
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:31,530
This means...

228
00:14:31,750 --> 00:14:33,570
this object is a real treasure !

229
00:14:33,710 --> 00:14:34,380
Guards,

230
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:37,590
Reward the Crown Prince with gold, silver and jade.

231
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:40,080
Your Highness,

232
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,280
where did you

233
00:14:41,560 --> 00:14:43,310
find this wood carving ?

234
00:15:02,110 --> 00:15:02,760
This...

235
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:04,770
So many treasures...

236
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:06,150
We're rich !

237
00:15:06,230 --> 00:15:07,110
Junior Brother,

238
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,510
we're rich !

239
00:15:12,140 --> 00:15:12,950
What ?!

240
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:25,870
Senior Brother,

241
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:28,080
this place is terrifying.

242
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:30,630
The greater the risk,

243
00:15:30,640 --> 00:15:31,650
the greater the gains.

244
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:32,750
Come on.

245
00:15:52,520 --> 00:15:54,500
Teleportation !?

246
00:15:56,590 --> 00:15:57,040
This...

247
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:58,800
Why is a Nascent Soul cultivator here !?

248
00:16:00,030 --> 00:16:01,760
You dared provoke the fiend,

249
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:03,470
you're doomed !

250
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:06,420
And I am the one who will devour your souls !

251
00:16:06,550 --> 00:16:07,070
Dead...

252
00:16:07,740 --> 00:16:08,620
We're so dead...

253
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:25,020
That will be a total of 4500 taels of gold.

254
00:16:25,390 --> 00:16:26,190
Pay up.

255
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:31,400
Paying respects to Senior,

256
00:16:31,470 --> 00:16:33,240
Juniors are disciples of the White Cloud Sect.

257
00:16:33,300 --> 00:16:35,440
We didn't know these carvings were Senior's.

258
00:16:35,950 --> 00:16:37,170
We are sorry for what we did,

259
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,970
please forgive us.

260
00:16:40,760 --> 00:16:42,070
4500 taels of gold...

261
00:16:42,740 --> 00:16:43,740
Do you have enough ?

262
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,280
Senior,

263
00:16:47,630 --> 00:16:49,540
I have some spirit stones.

264
00:16:49,830 --> 00:16:52,120
I don't have the gold mortals use.

265
00:17:03,070 --> 00:17:04,070
He won't kill them ?

266
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:05,580
How unfortunate...

267
00:17:05,990 --> 00:17:06,900
Get out.

268
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,030
Next time,

269
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:09,700
bring enough money.

270
00:17:11,100 --> 00:17:12,100
Wait for me !

271
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:23,990
The killing intent is gone.

272
00:17:29,600 --> 00:17:30,920
The Spring Festival is coming.

273
00:17:31,030 --> 00:17:33,360
This is a token of goodwill from the Crown Prince.

274
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:34,750
His Highness said,

275
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:36,940
that if Master Immortal needs help in the future,

276
00:17:37,190 --> 00:17:39,340
he's more than willing to help you out.

277
00:17:48,950 --> 00:17:49,790
Happy New Year !

278
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,050
Happy New Year !

279
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:02,100
Happy New Year Brother Liu !

280
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,810
Happy New Year !

281
00:18:03,830 --> 00:18:05,340
It's New Year already !

282
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,510
Uncle Wang,

283
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:21,110
why have I never seen these carvings before ?

284
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:22,710
Are they new ?

285
00:18:25,390 --> 00:18:26,960
They are the first I made,

286
00:18:27,080 --> 00:18:28,230
these carvings...

287
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:29,440
are my family.

288
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:41,510
Uncle Wang,

289
00:18:41,840 --> 00:18:43,280
my father told me

290
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:45,780
that shopkeeper Lu tried to marry his daughter to you.

291
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:47,180
Why did you refuse ?

292
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:51,260
I have secretly spied on her

293
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,780
and she is gorgeous !

294
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,390
Uncle has a wife.

295
00:18:57,860 --> 00:18:58,570
Really ?

296
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:01,980
How come I have never seen her ?

297
00:19:01,990 --> 00:19:03,740
She's waiting for me in a far away place.

298
00:19:04,320 --> 00:19:05,460
One day,

299
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:07,160
I'll go back to her.

300
00:19:14,290 --> 00:19:15,120
Wow !

301
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:17,560
She's so pretty.

302
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:46,440
I've had my share of wounds,

303
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:46,440
now I want to fight back.

304
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:50,000
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

305
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:55,920
that's blocking all my hopes

306
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:55,920
for life ?

307
00:19:57,720 --> 00:20:01,680
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

308
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:01,680
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

309
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:05,080
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

310
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:11,080
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

311
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:11,080
out of reach.

312
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:16,560
Immortals

313
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:16,560
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

314
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:20,600
Renegades

315
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:20,600
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

316
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:24,440
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

317
00:20:22,550 --> 00:20:24,440
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

318
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:28,560
because I don't see the harm in that.

319
00:20:30,560 --> 00:20:36,360
My new body opens its eyes

320
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:36,360
and awakens from its dream.

321
00:20:36,480 --> 00:20:43,920
I have overcome many trials

322
00:20:38,600 --> 00:20:43,920
to get this body back.

323
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:51,560
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

324
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:51,560
I can still see.

325
00:20:51,960 --> 00:21:00,920
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

326
00:20:55,920 --> 00:21:00,920
by my own hands.

327
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:37,760
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

328
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:37,760
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

329
00:21:37,760 --> 00:21:45,320
With a flick of a finger,

330
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:45,320
only my indomitable heart remains.

331
00:21:45,360 --> 00:21:54,720
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

332
00:21:51,320 --> 00:21:54,720
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

333
00:21:54,960 --> 00:22:02,560
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

334
00:21:57,480 --> 00:22:02,560
like the descent of a god.
